Error [E0350]: Jet does not have an `Any` type
  --> tests/ui/no_any_type.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     value: Any :: "anything"
    |            ^^^
 Why: a value should keep a precise shape: use an enum for known variants, generics or traits for abstraction, `T?` for absence, and `Data` for parsed dynamic data
 Fix: replace `Any` with the specific mechanism for this value
